# ==============================================================================
# NetFusion Framework — Standard Crontab Schedule
# Path   : /etc/cron.d/netfusion
# Author : Md. Atiquzzaman Ashish (DotNetBD)
# ==============================================================================

# Run the NetFusion schedule worker every minute as web user
* * * * * www-data /usr/bin/php /var/www/netfusion/netfusion schedule:run >> /dev/null 2>&1
